---
description: Prepare one trackArcs evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: CanonFact[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Identify unresolved setups, character goals, relationship changes, and narrative promises across installments. Distinguish intentional mystery from accidental omission, and preserve motivations that constrain plausible future actions without treating characters as mechanically fixed. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
